From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: anxelok <anxelok@localhost>
Date: Sat, 11 Jul 2026 00:17:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Confine parallel tick state

Move hopper and entity tick scratch state out of shared mutable fields so independent region workers do not race.

